'''Sowhsin-308b''' (sometimes quoted to be Adonia 2.0) based on its characteristics; also known by its Sowhsin object of interest designation SOI-3944.01) is a {{w|Earth analog|Adonia-like}} {{w|Exoplanet}} orbiting within the inner edge of the {{w|habitable zone}} of the {{w|Solar analog|sun-like}} star [[Sowhsin-308]] and is the only planet in the system discovered by the [[Sowhsin space telescope]]. It is about 1,800 light years away (550pc) from [[Adonia]] in the constellation of [[Saldhig]].

